{
  "title": "Warm Spicy Vietnamese Beef Bo Kho",
  "description": "A peppery and nostalgic Vietnamese dish featuring chinese broccoli and confit tomato, with a cheese pull effect, low in carbs and perfect for a weeknight dinner.",
