      "amount": "1/2 teaspoon"
    },
    {
      "name": "mozzarella cheese",
      "amount": "1/2 cup",
      "notes": "shredded"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large Dutch oven over medium high heat.",
    "Add the beef to the pot and cook until browned on all sides.",
    "Add the chinese broccoli, confit tomato, fish sauce, soy sauce, grated ginger, ground black pepper, and star anise to the pot.",
    "Pour in enough beef broth to cover the ingredients and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer for 2 hours or until the beef is tender.",
    "Stir in the shredded mozzarella cheese until melted and well combined.",
    "Serve the bo kho hot, garnished with additional chinese broccoli and mozzarella cheese if desired."
  ],
